        "text_preview": "6. In view of the above submissions, the only question which required to be looked into by this Court is that whether in absence of following the procedure under Section 42 of the Act, 2006 the prosecution can stand against the petitioner o"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "00068fbae1ba4ab4b8ea21b61f2cce9f_19",
